    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "When holidays arrive, people often go to the countryside for fresh air or stay indoors to enjoy shopping. But now there’s a new trend in China: industrial tourism. "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " just relaxing or spending money, more people are taking factory tours while on vacation."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Hu Sisi, a 29-year-old from Suzhou, tried it for the first time during this year’s May Day holiday. She and her friends visited a Chinese rice wine factory. They watched how "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "huangjiu"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " was made. They also tasted huangjiu-"
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "flavoured",
            "ref": "v-flavoured"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " drinks, including milk tea, coffee, and yogurt. “It was a new "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " for me to learn something while travelling,” said Hu."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Industrial tourism "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in Europe around the middle of the 20th century. It came to China in the late 1990s. Now, it’s becoming increasingly popular in China. There are more than 1,000 industrial tourist sites in the country. Some places attract large numbers of visitors. For example, the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Tsingtao Beer Museum",
            "zh": "青岛啤酒博物馆"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " over 1.8 million visitors last year."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Why do so many people like industrial tourism? It’s fun! Many sites have added "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " activities to their tours. Visitors can make cakes or watch robots build cars. Some factories even use 3D shows or VR experiences to make trips more interesting."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "But industrial tourism is more than just fun. It also helps build "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b7",
            "number": 7
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " between companies and customers. “When people don’t know "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b8",
            "number": 8
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " things are made, they may worry about quality. But if they see the whole process, they are more likely to trust the "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b9",
            "number": 9
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and the "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "brand",
            "ref": "v-brand"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ",” said a company manager."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Industrial tourism is a way to have fun, learn new things, and bring "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b10",
            "number": 10
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and brands closer. No "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "wonder",
            "ref": "v-wonder"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " it’s winning over fans in China."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
